      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELMSLEY (2) is a smart dog who pinged the lids and cleared the pack early, leading throughout to win (25.77) at this track in Free For All over 461m. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Form reads well for this. KING HASS (3) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (25.92) at this track in a Free For All over 461m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to be in this for a long way. INDY ALEX (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Launceston in a handy 29.53 beating Lochinvar Angel. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. One of the prime contenders. SELSDON (6) has won at this course and distance – one to keep very safe.",
